    "body": "\\(\\dfrac{a}{a^2-b^2}\\div\\dfrac{1}{a^2+ab}=\\dfrac{a}{(a+b)(a-b)}\\cdot a(a+b)=\\dfrac{a^2}{a-b}\\)。"
   },
   {
    "title": "同分母相减",
    "body": "原式 \\(=\\dfrac{a^2}{a-b}-\\dfrac{2ab-b^2}{a-b}=\\dfrac{a^2-2ab+b^2}{a-b}=\\dfrac{(a-b)^2}{a-b}=a-b\\)。"
   },
   {
    "title": "求a、b",
    "body": "\\(|a-2|\\ge0\\)，\\((b+1)^2\\ge0\\)，两者之和为0，只能都为0：\\(a=2\\)，\\(b=-1\\)。"
   },
   {
    "title": "代入",
    "body": "原式 \\(=a-b=2-(-1)=3\\)。"
   }
